Hello Climbers,
Our journey continues - Patch #4 was just deployed to improve the gameplay.

Thanks, y'all for the feedback delivered on Steam discussions, reviews, and our discord - keep it up!

Here are the changes:


Mount Everest
 Fixed camera and climbing dots map view when you were preparing for vertical climbing;
 Texture fixed next to checkpoint 7 while mountain rigging;

Cho Oyu
 You could fail while going towards the second camp and being on the green dots terrain only because you took a different route path;
 You could skip the ice terrain next to checkpoint 7 while cutting the low corners;

K2
 You could lost below an iced texture;
 In the first camp next to the tent there was an issue with object texture;
 You could get lost under the iced texture next to the first stone climbing after leaving the camp;

Manaslu 
 Fixed texture on the left next to the first climbing wall (not far away from the base camp);


Others
 Dutch language added (big thanks to LazySushi for the translation help);


If you have any issues feel free to send us game log files so we can investigate the problem:
C:\Users\{YOUR_USER_NAME}\AppData\LocalLow\A2Softworks\Climber Sky is the Limit"
to support@art-games.com

Stay tuned for the next updates.

Feel free to join our discord:
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36776987/ea7740b3445b6de5a79ccebc2e2b9a14654bbb6b.png


cheers,
AGS Team

